# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
*.egg-info/

# uv
.uv/
# Not committed: consumers install via `uv tool install .` or Homebrew, both
# of which resolve fresh, and both dependency lists already carry upper
# bounds (see tests/test_packaging.py); a lockfile here would only pin this
# maintainer's dev-time resolution and go stale immediately.
uv.lock

# Guard decision traces. These record what the guard saw, so they can contain
# fragments of the private content airlock exists to protect. Never commit them.
*.jsonl
decisions*.json

# macOS
.DS_Store

# Eval measurement outputs. Machine-specific timings that churn on every
# run, and the figures that matter are written up in eval/README.md.
eval/results/

# SDD process artifacts: implementer reports and ledgers. Scratch for how the
# work was done, not part of the tool. Kept on disk, never committed.
.superpowers/
